---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | Pixova"
  description="What cookies Pixova uses, why, and how to manage or withdraw your consent. Plain English."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.pixova.uk/cookie-policy/"
  noindex={true}
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="pt-14 pb-12" style="background-color:#E8F5F1;">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase" style="color:#2ECC9A;">LEGAL</span>
      <h1 class="font-heading font-semibold text-4xl sm:text-5xl mt-3 mb-4" style="color:#1C3557;">
        Cookie Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base max-w-xl" style="color:#1A2E3D;">
        What cookies we use and how to manage your preferences. Last updated: 16 May 2026.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTENT -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-offwhite">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="legal-content">

        <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
        <p>Cookies are small text files placed on your device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work, or to work more efficiently, and to provide information to the site owner.</p>
        <p>Some cookies are set by the website you are visiting (first-party cookies). Others are set by third-party services the website uses.</p>

        <h2>2. What cookies does Pixova use?</h2>

        <h3>Analytics cookies (Google Analytics 4)</h3>
        <p>We use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to understand how people use our website — which pages are visited, how long people stay, and where visitors come from (broadly, by country or region). These cookies do not identify you personally.</p>

        <table class="cookie-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Cookie name</th>
              <th>Purpose</th>
              <th>Duration</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><code>_ga</code></td>
              <td>Distinguishes unique users</td>
              <td>2 years</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>_ga_*</code></td>
              <td>Stores session state for GA4</td>
              <td>2 years</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <p>These cookies are only set <strong>after you click "Accept"</strong> on the cookie banner. If you click "Decline", no analytics cookies are placed.</p>

        <h3>Consent preference (local storage)</h3>
        <p>We store your cookie preference in your browser's local storage under the key <code>pixova_cookie_consent</code>. This is not a cookie — it is a small item saved in your browser to remember whether you clicked "Accept" or "Decline", so we do not show you the banner on every visit. It does not expire automatically; you can clear it at any time using the button below or by clearing your browser's site data.</p>

        <h3>No advertising or tracking cookies</h3>
        <p>We do not set any advertising, retargeting, or third-party tracking cookies. No social media pixels or profiling cookies are used on this site.</p>

        <h2>3. Third-party cookies</h2>
        <p>If you click through to embedded content or external links, those third-party sites may set their own cookies. We have no control over third-party cookies. Please refer to those sites' cookie or privacy policies for details.</p>

        <h2>4. Managing your consent</h2>

        <h3>Withdraw or change your consent</h3>
        <p>You can withdraw your consent at any time by clicking the button below. This will clear your saved preference and show the cookie banner again on your next page load, allowing you to make a new choice.</p>

        <div class="consent-action">
          <button id="withdraw-consent" type="button">Withdraw cookie consent</button>
          <p id="withdraw-msg" class="withdraw-msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>

        <h3>Browser settings</h3>
        <p>You can also control cookies through your browser settings. Most browsers let you block or delete cookies. Note that blocking analytics cookies will not affect your ability to use this site — all core functionality works without them.</p>
        <p>For guidance on how to manage cookies in your browser:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Chrome</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/clear-cookies-and-site-data-firefox" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mozilla Firefox</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/en-gb/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple Safari</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-gb/windows/manage-cookies-in-microsoft-edge-168dab11-0753-043d-7c16-ede5947fc64d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft Edge</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Google Analytics opt-out</h3>
        <p>You can also opt out of Google Analytics tracking across all websites using the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p>

        <h2>5. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this cookie policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it was last revised.</p>

        <h2>6. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about how we use cookies, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@pixova.uk">hello@pixova.uk</a>.</p>
        <p>For more detail on how we handle your personal data, see our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<script>
  const btn = document.getElementById('withdraw-consent');
  const msg = document.getElementById('withdraw-msg');

  btn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    localStorage.removeItem('pixova_cookie_consent');
    if (msg) {
      msg.textContent = 'Your consent preference has been cleared. Reload the page to see the cookie banner again.';
    }
    if (btn) {
      (btn as HTMLButtonElement).disabled = true;
      btn.textContent = 'Preference cleared';
    }
  });
</script>

<style>
  .legal-content {
    color: #1A2E3D;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .legal-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #1C3557;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #E8F5F1;
  }
  .legal-content h3 {
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #1C3557;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-content ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  .legal-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .legal-content a {
    color: #2ECC9A;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .legal-content a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .legal-content strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1C3557;
  }
  .legal-content code {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.875em;
    background: #E8F5F1;
    color: #1C3557;
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  /* Cookie table */
  .cookie-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .cookie-table th {
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1C3557;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    background: #E8F5F1;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #2ECC9A;
  }
  .cookie-table td {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(28, 53, 87, 0.08);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .cookie-table tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  /* Withdraw consent */
  .consent-action {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 1.75rem;
  }
  #withdraw-consent {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    background: #1C3557;
    border: none;
    padding: 0.55rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  #withdraw-consent:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  #withdraw-consent:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .withdraw-msg {
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #2ECC9A;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
